#: .\companies\templates\companies\ethiochicken.html:138
msgid ""
"Ethiochicken is a leading poultry company in Ethiopia, dedicated to "
"improving the livelihoods of smallholder farmers through the provision of "
"high-quality poultry products and services."
msgstr ""
"Ethiochicken kan Itoophiyaa keessatti lukkuu irratti hojjetu guddaadha, "
"qooda lukkuu gaarii kennuun qabeenya horsiistota xixiqqoo fooyyessuuf "
"kaffalame."

#: .\companies\templates\companies\ethiochicken.html:143
msgid "Our Mission"
msgstr "Kaayyoo Keenya"

#: .\companies\templates\companies\ethiochicken.html:144
msgid ""
"To enhance food security and create sustainable livelihoods in rural "
"communities through poultry farming."
msgstr ""
"Nyaataa eeguu fi jireenya gabbinaa godinaa keessatti lukkuu qonnaa irratti "
"hundaa'uun uumuu."

